{"ancestors": "0,9020774,9027208", "bizKey": "9027211", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-12-10 17:27:24", "detail": "<p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">1、华创证券在2022年5月通过参与司法拍卖的方式，以17.26亿元的对价获得太平洋7.44亿股股权（占总股本10.92%）。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/12/10/51c3641f-4b7d-4173-85ce-2b24f2393cdb-1702200008992.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 412.99px;height: 337.78px;\"/></p><p><br></p><p>2、2023年<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">9月21日晚间，太平洋发布公告称，其于当日收到证监会出具的行政许可申请受理单。证监会就太平洋关于变更主要股东或者实际控制人的行政许可申请事项依法予以受理。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/12/10/d0c5185c-fe7c-4b37-8c91-df225bf40543-1702200106267.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 394.98px;height: 286.86px;\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "HCYTP", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "华创与太平", "parentId": 9027208, "pctChg": -1.12, "reason": "华创与太平", "remark": "", "sort": 3, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9027211, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-12-11 17:43:21"}
